cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CryoStack"
abstract: >-
  CryoStack is an open-source cyberinfrastructure stack for assembling
  reproducible cryosphere workflows from scientific applications, user
  workspaces, data catalogs, simulation configurations, and heterogeneous
  execution resources. It connects ice-sheet modeling, ensemble data
  assimilation, and radar observations behind one shared platform.
